# The fuzzer (tests/Fuzz.idr) on seed 1: closed expressions over every
# primitive, each written four ways, compiled once per part at the seed's
# thread count; each case's lines must print one value, the folders must
# have computed every d line, and a case over the integers must print the
# value their documented meaning gives.
# Two compilations of generated programs, and a shrink's when a case fails,
# given half an hour.
test_limit=1800
. "$IDRIS_MLIR_ROOT/tests/testutils.sh"
fuzz 1
